  m_text: "enviroment art:\n\nzone 1: Bayane.K\n\nzone 2: Bayane.K\n\nzone 3: Ash.K\n\nzone
    4: Ash.k\n\nZone 5: Ash.K\n\n\n\n\n\nOBSTACLE ART:\n\nALL ZONES: Ash.K\n\n\n\n\n\ncharacter
    art:\n\nCharacter animation: bayane.K\n\ncharacter sprites: Bayane.K\n\n\n\n\n\nUSER
    INterface art:\n\nGAME over screen: BAyane\n\nMAin menu BG: ASH.K\n\nall buttons:
    Bayane.K\n\nEnd level screens: Bayane.K\n\n\n\n\n\nSOund effects SOurcers:\n\nMENU:
    Ash.K\n\nLEVEL SFX: BAYANE.k\n\n\n\n\n\npreproduction credits:\n\nMVP: Ben.P\n\nRisk
    assesment: Ben.P\n\nasset list: Ben.P\n\nPreproduction schedule: Ben.P\n\nConcept
    art: Ash.k, Bayane.K\n\nPrevis: Ash.K, Bayane.K\n\nLevel Plan: Ash.K, Bayane.K\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOther
    roles:\n\nProgrammer: BEn.P \n\ncredits maker: Ben.P\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nshout outs:\nALEX.O,
    CURTIS, Mik.N, mo, noga.S\n\nruby\n (for supporting ash)\n\nMOdestas\n(ABsolute
    Legend)\n\njojos bizzare adevnture lofi music\n(For helping bayane?)\n\nThe player\n(For
    playing our game!)\n\n\n\n\n\nGame idea by ben parsons\n\n\n\n\n\n\nA game by
    purple elephant games\n\nA game By ben.P, Ash.K, Bayane.K\n\n(no animals was
    harmed in the making of this game)\n\nthanks for PLaying!!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(You
    have now unlocked level select!)\n\nGo back to start here:\n\n\n\n"
